==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-heyday.ogg|Audio (US)}}
*: {{rhymes|eɪdeɪ}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[period]] of [[success]], [[popularity]] or [[power]]; [[prime]].
#: ''The early twentieth century was the '''heyday''' of the steam locomotive.''

